    "description": "Everything the store sells, with the numbers that decide what to reorder and what it earns. Cost and retail price give profit, margin and markup; stock on hand less what is reserved gives what is really available; and stock at cost shows what is sitting on the shelves. Products drop to Low stock below their reorder point and to Out of stock at zero on their own.",
